The '''sunfire fanatic cuirass''' is an item that requires level 60 [[Prayer]] and 40 [[Defence]] to equip, obtained as a possible reward from participating in the [[Fortis Colosseum]].

Part of the [[sunfire fanatic armour]] set, it provides the [[best in slot]] prayer bonus for the body slot, and also has identical defence bonuses to the [[rune platebody]]. The armour does not stop [[Ava's device|Ava's devices]] from gathering [[arrows]].

